      "narrative": null,
      "content": "The World Health Organization (WHO) would like to thank the members of the Guideline \nDevelopment Group and the Methodology Group for their constant availability and hard work. WHO \nis also very grateful to the External Review Group for making possible the development of these \nessential recommendations for screening and treatment of precancerous lesions for cervical cancer \nprevention. The names of the participants in each group are listed on pages v–viii.\nIn addition, we would like to thank the following staff, fellows, and students from McMaster \nUniversity, Hamilton, Canada, who contribute",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Thanks the guideline groups and McMaster University staff and students who worked on the systematic review. It names the main funders, the Flanders International Cooperation Agency, France's Institut National du Cancer and the GAVI Alliance, and the editing firm.",
